sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI as HF static workspace UI
  participant Auth as Scoped credential handling
  participant AO as Rivet AgentOS
  participant VM as Isolated VM / runner
  participant FS as Workspace filesystem
  participant Proc as Shell / process runtime

  User->>UI: Open coding workspace
  UI->>Auth: Provide scoped runtime credential
  Auth->>AO: Authenticate and connect
  AO-->>UI: Connection or session result
  Note over UI,AO: The connection path and authentication contract still require runtime verification.

  User->>UI: Select or initialize workspace
  UI->>AO: Workspace operation
  AO->>VM: Route operation to execution environment
  VM->>FS: List, read, or write project files
  FS-->>UI: File results

  User->>UI: Submit command
  UI->>AO: Execute command request
  AO->>VM: Start process
  VM->>Proc: Run shell command
  Proc->>FS: Read or write workspace files
  Proc-->>AO: stdout, stderr, exit code
  AO-->>UI: Execution result and status
  UI-->>User: Display terminal output

  Note over UI,Auth: Do not store credentials in browser local storage. Clear in-memory credentials on disconnect.
  Note over AO,VM: Isolation, filesystem boundaries, and resource limits must be enforced by the runtime.
  User->>UI: Disconnect
  UI->>Auth: Clear in-memory credential
  Note over AO,FS: Reconnection and workspace persistence remain to be verified.